      {
        "text": "Perla Tirado has served as a Cook County Circuit Court judge since 2020. She presides over the Civil Jury Section in the First Municipal District. Before joining the bench, she was an assistant public defender and a partner in private practice. She also served as a supervising attorney at Beyond Legal Aid. She has presided over eviction cases and the Consumer Debt Early Resolution Program.",
